"Let's validate this argument. We use:\n"
"* §0 : the tax rate is going up\n"
"* §1 : the unemployment is going up\n"
"* §2 : the GDP is going up\n"
"* §3 : there will be a recession.\n"
">\n"
"See how the statement of this level is precisely this argument?"
msgstr ""

