"In this level, we have an assumption that is existentially quantified. In order to use that assumption, we need to use the principle of **Existential elimination**. Specifically, if we know that §0, then we can deduce that there must be some specific element §1 of type §2 such that §3 is true. In order to *obtain* such a witness we use ...\n"
"### **❯ The §4 tactic ... again**\n"
"To grab a witness of an existential assumption, we use the §5 tactic with some extra syntax. In our case, 👉 try:\n"
"§6\n"
"The §7 is our witness, the §8 is the proof that §9.\n"
"### **⌨ Typesetting tip**\n"
"In order to get the *angled brackets* §10 and §11 use §12 and §13."
